                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Markaz Imam Ahmad bin Hanbal is a center for Islamic learning and Qur'an memorization located in Kozhikode, Kerala. Named after the great scholar Imam Ahmad, we focus on helping students build a strong connection to the Book of Allah and the authentic ways of the Prophet.</p>
